      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milam%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town lies on the Old San Antonio Road, North America’s oldest roadway, first used by Spanish soldiers in the 1700s.",
